{"event":"pre_tool","ts":1772970363357,"session":"ralph-20260308-113625","tool":"task","args":"{\"agent_type\": \"ralph.ralph-writer\", \"description\": \"Implement membership code samples migration\", \"mode\": \"sync\", \"prompt\": \"Implement documentation changes for DOC-3187: Migrate registration and authentication code samples to webapp.\\n\\nThis task involves the code samples project. Read the ralph-code-samples and ralph-codesamples-project skills for code_link workflow and solution structure. Build with `npm run codesamples:build` to verify C# files compile.\\n\\nThe researcher's report is at `.ralph/tasks/DOC-3187/artifacts/ralph-researcher/output.md` — read it for the full implementation plan including file paths, marker IDs, code_link tag syntax, and inline code blocks to replace.\\n\\nKey constraints:\\n- Reuse existing AccountController.cs with `//Include:` markers to hide ShoppingCartService coupling\\n- Integrate password reset and email confirmation into webapp flow (not standalone)\\n- External auth samples stay standalone (needs external config like Google)\\n- Views go under src/Codesamples/Views sorted by convention\\n- Small Program.cs config snippets (2-5 lines) stay inline in docs\\n- Namespace: `Codesamples.Membership.Standalone` for standalone samples only\\n- Fix `ApplicationUserManager<TUser>` → `UserManager<TUser>` in doc comments (2 occurrences in add-fields-to-member-objects.md)\\n- All new C# files must compile with `npm run codesamples:build`\\n\"}"}
